WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.900
Ryu falls from the prerequisite corner forward throw.

2
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:01.150
The Rush standing light punch intentionally whiffs before Ryu’s reversal.

3
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:02.000
Arjun holds down-back and guards the recorded Ryu OD uppercut.

4
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:02.800
The guarded OD uppercut rises above Arjun while he remains defending.

5
